Phone 843-661-1715 Departments Center for Academic Success and Advisement Chemistry Tutoring Center Office LSF 303A Additional information Jessica N. McCutcheon Faculty Secretary Dr. Fries Karen Dr. Karen Fries Professor of Education kfries@fmarion.edu Phone 843-661-1438 Departments School of Education Office SOBE 258 More info ✖ Dr. Fries Karen Dr. Karen Fries Professor of Education kfries@fmarion.edu Phone 843-661-1438 Departments School of Education Office SOBE 258 Additional information - Office hours are posted on syllabus. Please email to schedule an appointment. Faculty Secretary Areas of Specialization Learning Disabilities Mathematics 2026-2027 FMU Faculty Committees https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/2026-2027-Committees.pdf Fall 2026 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Fall-26-1.pdf Spring 2027 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Spring-27-1.pdf 2025-2026 FMU Faculty Committees (Nov. 11) https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2025-2026-Committees-Nov.-11.pdf Spring 2026 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Spring-26-Calendar.pdf Fall 2025 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Fall-25-Calendar.pdf 2024-2025 FMU Faculty Committees https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2024-2025-Committees-Final.pdf Fall 2024 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Fall-24-Calendar.pdf Spring 2025 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Spring-25-Calendar.pdf Fall 2023 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Fall-2023-Schedule.pdf Spring 2024 Faculty Governance Schedule https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Spring-2024-Sept.-4-2023.pdf 2023-2024 Faculty Committees https://www.fmarion.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/2023-2024-Committees-Final.